 lights. His first design did not work properly. Sometimes the lights turned off while someone was still in the room. Instead of giving up, Leo tested different sensors and adjusted his design. After several attempts, he developed a working model. His science teacher encouraged him to present it.\",\"confidence\":0.97704065,\"accuracy\":94,\"pronunciation\":88,\"fluency\":88,\"completeness\":96,\"prosody\":81.1,\"offset\":302800000,\"duration\":312400000},{\"text\":\"At the school\'s invention fair, Leo did not win first place, but he learned that successful inventions often require patience, testing and improvement.\",\"confidence\":0.98065484,\"accuracy\":94,\"pronunciation\":86.7,\"fluency\":91,\"completeness\":96,\"prosody\":76.2,\"offset\":615800000,\"duration\":136200000}],\"raw\":[{\"text\":\"Leo enjoyed taking apart broken household objects to understand how they worked. His parents often reminded him to put the objects back together, but they noticed that he was naturally curious about machines. 1 summer, Leo became interested in the amount of electricity used by lights that were accidentally left on.\",\"offset\":14500000,\"duration\":282300000},{\"text\":\"He designed a simple that device that could detect when a room was empty and automatically turn off the lights. His first design did not work properly. Sometimes the lights turned off while someone was still in the room. Instead of giving up, Leo tested different sensors and adjusted his design. After several attempts, he developed a working model. His science teacher encouraged him to present it.\",\"offset\":302800000,\"duration\":312400000},{\"text\":\"At the school\'s invention fair, Leo did not win first place, but he learned that successful inventions often require patience, testing and improvement.\",\"offset\":615800000,\"duration\":136200000}],\"diagnostics\":{\"recognizedResults\":3,\"wordEvidence\":141,\"recognizingResults\":126,\"noMatchResults\":0,\"canceledResults\":1,\"audioBytesReceived\":2418560,\"sessionStarted\":true,\"sessionStopped\":true,\"serviceConnected\":true,\"lastRecognizedText\":\"At the school\'s invention fair, Leo did not win first place, but he learned that successful inventions often require patience, testing and improvement.\",\"sdkVersion\":\"1.34.0\",\"jsonWordEvidence\":141,\"sdkWordEvidence\":141,\"resultJsonBytes\":42895,\"audioWriterAlive\":false,\"writerFailed\":false},\"error\":null,\"finalSeen\":true,\"doneSeen\":true},\"realtime\":{\"transcript\":\"Leo enjoyed taking apart broken household objects to understand how they worked. His parents often reminded him to put the objects back together, but they noticed that he was naturally curious about machines. One summer, Leo became interested in the amount of electricity used by lights that were accidentally left on. He designed a simple device that could detect when a room was empty and automatically turn off the lights. His first design did not work properly. Sometimes the lights turned off while someone was still in the room. Instead of giving up, Leo tested different sensors and adjusted his design. After several attempts, he developed a working model. His science teacher encouraged him to present it at a school invention fair. Leo did not win first place, but he learned that successful invention often require patience, testing, and improvements\",\"enabled\":true,\"model\":\"gpt-live-transcribe\",\"requestedModel\":\"gpt-live-transcribe\",\"context\":\"keywords-only\",\"delay\":600,\"vad\":{\"start_threshold\":0.018,\"stop_threshold\":0.012,\"silence_duration_ms\":1500,\"min_speech_ms\":180}},\"pipeline\":{\"realtimeTranscription\":\"gpt-live-transcribe\",\"requestedRealtimeTranscription\":\"gpt-live-transcribe\",\"realtimeTranscriptionContext\":\"keywords-only\",\"realtimeTranscriptionDelay\":600,\"realtimeVAD\":{\"start_threshold\":0.018,\"stop_threshold\":0.012,\"silence_duration_ms\":1500,\"min_speech_ms\":180},\"batchTranscription\":\"disabled\",\"pronunciation\":\"Azure Speech Pronunciation Assessment\",\"comparison\":\"reference passage + OpenAI literal transcript + continuous Azure scripted pronunciation/timing evidence\",\"audioDurationSeconds\":75.016,\"azureStreaming\":true,\"azureReferenceText\":\"hidden-passage\",\"azureFinalSeen\":true,\"azureDoneSeen\":true,\"openaiTranscriptionPasses\":1,\"note\":\"Assessment markup is withheld until Azure finalization completes. OpenAI remains the visible literal transcript; Azure supplies pronunciation evidence only.\"}}',100,'Instructional','Completed','uploads/audio/attempt_15_1791630600.webm','2026-10-10 11:10:00');
