 after classes. The project showed the students that a community can accomplish great things when people contribute their time and resources.\",\"offset\":314600000,\"duration\":204900000}],\"diagnostics\":{\"recognizedResults\":2,\"wordEvidence\":112,\"recognizingResults\":91,\"noMatchResults\":0,\"canceledResults\":1,\"audioBytesReceived\":1663360,\"sessionStarted\":true,\"sessionStopped\":true,\"serviceConnected\":true,\"lastRecognizedText\":\"After two months, the unused classroom had become a comfortable reading room. Students could now read during breaks and after classes. The project showed the students that a community can accomplish great things when people contribute their time and resources.\",\"sdkVersion\":\"1.34.0\",\"jsonWordEvidence\":112,\"sdkWordEvidence\":112,\"resultJsonBytes\":72397,\"audioWriterAlive\":false,\"writerFailed\":false},\"error\":null,\"finalSeen\":true,\"doneSeen\":true},\"realtime\":{\"transcript\":\"When the old library in Green Valley School became too small to properly ask the students what could be done, many students suggested building a larger reading area. The school could not afford building completely new building so teachers and parents looked for another solution. They decided to renovate an unused classroom. The students helped organize books while parents repaired shelves and painted the walls. Business local donated additional books, tables and chairs. After two months the unused classroom had become a comfortable reading room. The students could now read during breaks. And after classes, this project showed that students and community can accomplish great things when people contribute their time and resources\",\"enabled\":true,\"model\":\"gpt-live-transcribe\",\"requestedModel\":\"gpt-live-transcribe\",\"context\":\"keywords-only\",\"delay\":600,\"vad\":{\"start_threshold\":0.018,\"stop_threshold\":0.012,\"silence_duration_ms\":1500,\"min_speech_ms\":180}},\"pipeline\":{\"realtimeTranscription\":\"gpt-live-transcri