 the school\'s invention fair. Leo did not first place, but he learned that successful inventions often.\",\"confidence\":0.9468719,\"accuracy\":82,\"pronunciation\":78.7,\"fluency\":78,\"completeness\":89,\"prosody\":72.2,\"offset\":532300000,\"duration\":296300000},{\"text\":\"Require patience, testing and improvement.\",\"confidence\":0.976391,\"accuracy\":82,\"pronunciation\":84.6,\"fluency\":100,\"completeness\":80,\"prosody\":80.9,\"offset\":832400000,\"duration\":26300000}],\"raw\":[{\"text\":\"Leo enjoyed taking apart broken household objects to understand how they worked. His parents often reminded him to put the objects back together, but they noticed that he was naturally curious about machines.\",\"offset\":16000000,\"duration\":186400000},{\"text\":\"One summer, Leo became interested in the amount of electricity used by lights that were accidentally left on. He designed a simple device that could detect when a room was empty and automatically turn off the lights. His first design did not work properly. Sometimes the lights turned off while someone was still in the room.\",\"offset\":231400000,\"duration\":293600000},{\"text\":\"Instead of giving up, Leo tested different sensors and adjusted his design. After several attempts, he developed a working model. His science teacher and encouraged but him to present it at the school\'s invention fair. Leo did not first place, but he learned that successful inventions often.\",\"offset\":532300000,\"duration\":296300000},{\"text\":\"Require patience, testing and improvement.\",\"offset\":832400000,\"duration\":26300000}],\"diagnostics\":{\"recognizedResults\":4,\"wordEvidence\":141,\"recognizingResults\":128,\"noMatchResults\":0,\"canceledResults\":1,\"audioBytesReceived\":2942080,\"sessionStarted\":true,\"sessionStopped\":true,\"serviceConnected\":true,\"lastRecognizedText\":\"Require patience, testing and improvement.\",\"sdkVersion\":\"1.34.0\",\"jsonWordEvidence\":141,\"sdkWordEvidence\":141,\"resultJsonByte