e students that a community can accomplish great things when the people contribute their time and resources.\",\"confidence\":0.96527815,\"accuracy\":94,\"pronunciation\":84.4,\"fluency\":96,\"completeness\":98,\"prosody\":67,\"offset\":343700000,\"duration\":150600000}],\"raw\":[{\"text\":\"When the old library in Green Valley School became too small, the principal asked the students what could be done. Many students suggested building a larger reading area. The school could not afford to build a completely new building, so the teachers, the teachers, and the parents looked for another solution. They decided to renovate an unused classroom. Students helped organize old books while parents repaired shelves and painted the walls. Local businesses donated additional books, tables and chairs.\",\"offset\":9300000,\"duration\":333400000},{\"text\":\"After two months, the unused classroom had become a comfortable reading room. Students could now read during breaks and after classes. The project showed the students that a community can accomplish great things when the people contribute their time and resources.\",\"offset\":343700000,\"duration\":150600000}],\"diagnostics\":{\"recognizedResults\":2,\"wordEvidence\":120,\"recognizingResults\":104,\"noMatchResults\":0,\"canceledResults\":1,\"audioBytesReceived\":1582720,\"sessionStarted\":true,\"sessionStopped\":true,\"serviceConnected\":true,\"lastRecognizedText\":\"After two months, the unused classroom had become a comfortable reading room. Students could now read during breaks and after classes. The project showed the students that a community can accomplish great things when the people contribute their time and resources.\",\"sdkVersion\":\"1.34.0\",\"jsonWordEvidence\":120,\"sdkWordEvidence\":120,\"resultJsonBytes\":73208,\"audioWriterAlive\":false,\"writerFailed\":false},\"error\":null,\"finalSeen\":true,\"doneSeen\":true},\"realtime\":{\"transcript\":\"When the old library in Green Valley School became too small, the principal asked the students what could be done. Many students suggested building a larger reading area. The school could not afford to build a completely new building, so the teachers and the parents looked for another solution. They decided to renovate an unused classroom. Students helped organize old books while parents repaired shelves and painted the walls. Local businesses donated additional books, tables, and chairs. After two months, the unused classroom had become a comfortable reading room. Students could now read during breaks and after class. The project showed the students that the community can accomplish great things when the people contribute their time and resources.\",\"enabled\":true,\"model\":\"gpt-live-transcribe\",\"requestedModel\":\"gpt-live-transcribe\",\"context\":\"keywords-only\",\"delay\":600,\"vad\":{\"start_threshold\":0.018,\"stop_threshold\":0.012,\"silence_duration_ms\":1500,\"min_speech_ms\":180}},\"pipeline\":{\"realtimeTranscription\":\"gpt-live-transcribe\",\"requestedRealtimeTranscription\":\"gpt-live-transcribe\",\"realtimeTranscriptionContext\":\"keywords-only\",\"realtimeTranscriptionDelay\":600,\"realtimeVAD\":{\"start_threshold\":0.018,\"stop_threshold\":0.012,\"silence_duration_ms\":1500,\"min_speech_ms\":180},\"batchTranscription\":\"disabled\",\"pronunciation\":\"Azure Speech Pronunciation Assessment\",\"comparison\":\"reference passage + OpenAI literal transcript + continuous Azure scripted pronunciation/timing evidence\",\"audioDurationSeconds\":49.063,\"azureStreaming\":true,\"azureReferenceText\":\"hidden-passage\",\"azureFinalSeen\":true,\"azureDoneSeen\":true,\"openaiTranscriptionPasses\":1,\"note\":\"Assessment markup is withheld until Azure finalization completes. OpenAI remains the visible literal transcript; Azure supplies pronunciation evidence only.\"}}',20,'Frustration','Completed','uploads/audio/attempt_43_1791844740.webm','2026-10-12 22:39:00');
